    "created_at": "2016-04-06T09:37:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-06T09:37:29Z",
    "body": "I think the model you propose makes sense, that every time we queue a task to resolve or reject pending play promises, we also pass the list of promises and empty the internal list. We talked about a number of strange cases like this but apparently didn't consider all of them, so a simpler model will likely lead to fewer bugs of this sort. Care to PR this?\n",
